        "created_at": "2016-02-19T20:46:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"UXM266\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/uxm266/48/1966_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> UXM266:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><b>MigrantP wrote:</b></p>\n<div><blockquote>We have plans to add the Hero Challenge Achievements published by GTG.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nEven the Two Hero team one from the very beginning? That will be some fun coding!\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>There is no such thing in the Hero Challenge Achievements document (<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/system/files/downloads/Hero%20Challenge%20Achievements.pdf\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>, for reference).</p>",
