        "id": 162179,
        "name": "MigrantP",
        "username": "MigrantP",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-19T20:51:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"armadagon\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/armadagon/48/2379_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> armadagon:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Last night, I had a game against The Chairman with Mr. Fixer where I didn't get the progress notification for the Nemesis achievement, even though Fixer dealt the final blow to both Chairman and Operative. &nbsp;Fixer offed the Chairman before the Operative, so could this be the cause?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes, you would need to end the game with Mr. Fixer hitting The Chairman.</p>",
