        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-19T20:53:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think that UXM266 was thinking of the <a href=\"http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/system/files/downloads/StoryChallenges.pdf\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Story Challenges</a>.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>armadagon wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Last night, I had a game against The Chairman with Mr. Fixer where I didn't get the progress notification for the Nemesis achievement, even though Fixer dealt the final blow to both Chairman and Operative. &nbsp;Fixer offed the Chairman before the Operative, so could this be the cause?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nYes, you would need to end the game with Mr. Fixer hitting The Chairman.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Does this mean that Visionary can't take part in this achievement?</p>",
